<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>MELO / INVITATION</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="admin-invite.css?v=3b5f160">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="invite-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">♫</div>
        <div><div class="brand-name">MELO</div><small class="brand-sub">Control Room</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="top-label"><span>●</span>Administrator invitation</div>
    </header>
    <section class="invite-card" aria-labelledby="title">
      <div class="card-head"><p class="eyebrow">Administrator access</p><h1 id="title">Your invitation is here.</h1><p class="card-copy" id="copy">Checking your invitation…</p></div>
      <div class="steps" aria-label="Account setup progress"><div class="step active"><span class="step-dot">1</span><span>Set up</span></div><div class="step"><span class="step-dot">2</span><span>Verify</span></div><div class="step"><span class="step-dot">3</span><span>Enter MELO</span></div></div>
      <div class="setup-area">
        <div id="start"><div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span><span>Invited account</span><b id="startUsername">—</b></div><div class="start-panel"><div class="start-panel-copy"><strong>Connect your Authenticator</strong><span>Set up two-factor authentication before entering the protected Control Room.</span></div><button class="primary" id="begin" type="button">SET UP AUTHENTICATOR&nbsp; →</button></div></div>
        <div id="setup" class="hidden">
          <div class="setup-intro"><div class="intro-icon">⌁</div><div><div class="intro-title">One last security step</div><div class="intro-copy">Add MELO to your authenticator, then confirm the 6-digit code it gives you.</div></div></div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span><span>Administrator</span><b id="username">—</b></div>
          <div class="auth-grid"><div class="qr-side"><div class="qr-frame"><img id="qr" alt="Authenticator QR code"></div><div class="qr-caption">Scan with your authenticator app</div></div><div class="manual-side"><div class="manual-title">Can't scan the QR code?</div><p class="manual-copy">Enter this setup key manually in Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Authy, or another compatible app.</p><div class="key-box"><div class="key" id="key"></div><button class="copy-key" id="copyKey" type="button" aria-label="Copy setup key" title="Copy setup key">⧉</button></div></div></div>
          <div class="verify-row"><div class="field"><label for="code">6-digit authenticator code</label><input id="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" placeholder="000000" aria-label="6-digit authenticator code"></div><button class="primary" id="verify" type="button">VERIFY &amp; ENTER&nbsp; →</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="message" id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="footer"><span class="note">MELO · Music for a softer day.</span><span class="secure">Protected administrator setup</span></footer>
  </main>
  <script src="admin-invite.js?v=3b5f160"></script>
</body>
</html>
